  "description": "When Tae-Yul moves to a quiet new town, strange things start happening — a bus drives itself, food is served in a restaurant with no staff, and the sky changes color with the flicker of a streetlight. And each time, a mysterious man chides and saves him before disappearing. But who, or what, could he be?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
